+| [ ] 1.7 | Smartbar: pin up to 3 chips, try a 4th, try to pin or reorder the mic chip. | Fourth pin rejected, mic is never pinned or reordered, order survives a keyboard restart. Translate and AI chips are not shown at all. | T7 |
